{# templates/teams.j2 #}

{%- macro render_plan(meals) -%}
    {%- set diet = {'veg': '🌱', 'V': '🥕'} -%}
    {% for meal in meals -%}
        - {{ meal['name']['de'] }} ({{ "%.2f € | "|format(meal['prices']['student']) if meal['prices']['student'] is not none}}{{ "%.2f €"|format(meal['prices']['employee']) if meal['prices']['employee'] is not none else '??' }})
        {%- for flag in (meal['flags'] or []) if flag in diet %} {{ diet[flag] }}{% endfor -%}
        {{ '\n' }}
    {%- else -%}
        keine Einträge :(
    {%- endfor %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set text -%}
Abstimmung bzgl. Mittagsessen heute, per Reaktion auf diese Nachricht:

Mensa = 1️⃣
{{ render_plan(mensa) }}

Reimanns = 2️⃣
{{ render_plan(reimanns) }}

Home Office = 3️⃣
send pics!

Pick up Achim = 🙋‍♂️
Pick up Thomas = 🙆‍♂️
Pick up Patrizia = 🙋‍♀️

Preise: Studierende | Mitarbeitende · 🌱 vegan · 🥕 vegetarisch

beep boop
{%- endset -%}

